245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 85 0 R
/T ("Let's start with the purpose of the project.)
/E ("Let's start with the purpose of the project.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 85 0 R
/T (In any real organization, like a college, data security is very important. For example, a student or faculty from the EEE department should not be able to see the records of ECE or CSE departments.)
/E (In any real organization, like a college, data security is very important. For example, a student or faculty from the EEE department should not be able to see the records of ECE or CSE departments.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 85 0 R
/T (But by default in ServiceNow, if a user has access to a table, he can see all records. That is a security risk.)
/E (But by default in ServiceNow, if a user has access to a table, he can see all records. That is a security risk.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 85 0 R
/T (So the purpose of this project is to implement record-level security using Script-Controlled Access Control List, or ACL. We will create a condition where only users who have the EEE branch role can view records where the Branch field is EEE. At the same time, the system admin will retain full access to all records, irrespective of the branch.)
/E (So the purpose of this project is to implement record-level security using Script-Controlled Access Control List, or ACL. We will create a condition where only users who have the EEE branch role can view records where the Branch field is EEE. At the same time, the system admin will retain full access to all records, irrespective of the branch.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (This is called field-value based restriction.")
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 86 0 R
/T (USES AND BENEFITS)
/E (USES AND BENEFITS)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E ("Now, what are the uses and benefits?)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (First benefit is Data Security and Confidentiality. We are isolating data branch-wise.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (Second is Role-Based Access Control. We are using four custom roles - bb1 for Read operation, bb2 for Create, bb3 for Write, and bb4 for Delete. So we can finely control who can do what.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (Third, this is a real-world use case. This logic is used in colleges, HR management systems, hospital management, where data is separated by department or location.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (Fourth, we are not changing the UI or writing Business Rules. The entire security is handled at the ACL layer, which is the most secure way in ServiceNow.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
