274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 90 0 R
/T (Open bracket function, close bracket. Inside, if gs dot hasRole admin, return true. If gs dot hasRole bb1, return true. Otherwise return false. This script means, if the user is admin, allow full access. If the user has bb1 role, allow access, but the data condition will filter only EEE records. For all others, deny.)
/E (Open bracket function, close bracket. Inside, if gs dot hasRole admin, return true. If gs dot hasRole bb1, return true. Otherwise return false. This script means, if the user is admin, allow full access. If the user has bb1 role, allow access, but the data condition will filter only EEE records. For all others, deny.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
